'''Cafeteria Cat''' (ネコ給食当番, ''Neko Kyūshokutōban'', '''Cat School Lunch Duty''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Food Stall Cat Awakes!]]. They were added in [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Cafeteria Cat
|image = E 701.png
|appearance = [[Food Stall Cat Awakes!]]
|money drop = 1,500¢ - 5,925¢
}}

==Enemy==
Cafeteria Cat may look like a joke similarly to most other Awakened Cats, until you realize why exactly you can only fight this enemy after [[Stories of Legend]]. With a guaranteed chance to [[Curse]] any surviving cat for 3 seconds and also having the [[Immune to Slow|Immunity to Slow]], this boss will rush down your frontlines with an [[Omni Strike]] that can reach many units if not careful.

==Strategy==
Cafeteria's backswing is pretty long, allowing you to use fast units like [[Jelly Dumpling Cat]] to sneak in hits. [[Dogumaru (Special Cat)|Dogumaru]] is also useful to tank hits while having Curse Immunity to block Cafeteria's Curse.

