==Trivia==
*Cafeteria Cat is based on the fact that in most Japanese schools, students will put on white coats and caps, then [[wikipedia:School lunch in Japan#Current|collect and deliver]] the school's lunches to their classrooms.
*Cafeteria Cat is one of the five non-[[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] enemies to have the Curse ability, the others being [[Master Uril (Enemy)|Master Uril]], the [[Relic Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Relic Doge Base]], [[Malevolent Dark Cat]] and [[Sage of Selection Darvin]].

